{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">DEFINED preprocessor function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/309282","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/DEFINED-preprocessor-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/DEFINED-preprocessor-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"DEFINED-preprocessor-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">DEFINED preprocessor function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Returns the status of a preprocessor name or\ninclude file argument name as an INTEGER value. You can use the\nDEFINED function only within a preprocessor &amp;IF expression.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"DEFINED-preprocessor-function__syntax_GC16GK2688993\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d114687e96\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"DEFINED-preprocessor-function__idGDJ29T2668163\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>DEFINED ( <var class=\"keyword varname\">name</var> )</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">name</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">Preprocessor name or include file argument name whose status you want to check. You do\n            not specify <var class=\"keyword varname\">name</var> as a preprocessor name reference or include file\n            argument reference. That is, it is not quoted and does not appear in the reference form,\n              {&amp;<var class=\"keyword varname\">name</var>}. For example if you had a preprocessor name\n            MAX-EXPENSE, the argument would appear as follows:<table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"DEFINED-preprocessor-function__idGDJ29U2668169\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n                  <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n                    <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                      <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>DEFINED(MAX-EXPENSE)</code></pre>\n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                </tbody></table></dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"DEFINED-preprocessor-function__notes_GC16GL2689002\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d114687e165\">Notes</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">This\nfunction returns a value of 1 if the argument was a name defined\nwith the &amp;GLOBAL-DEFINE directive; a value of 2 if the argument\nwas passed as an include file parameter; and a value of 3 if the\nargument was a name defined with the &amp;SCOPED-DEFINE directive.\nIf the argument was not defined and was not an include file parameter,\nthen this function returns a value of 0. The value returned refers\nto the definition that is current at the point of the call.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"DEFINED-preprocessor-function__see-also_GC16GM2689006\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d114687e174\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"Include-file-reference.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Include-file-reference.html\">{ } Include file reference</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"ampGLOBAL-DEFINE-preprocessor-directive.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ampGLOBAL-DEFINE-preprocessor-directive.html\">&amp;GLOBAL-DEFINE preprocessor directive</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"ampSCOPED-DEFINE-preprocessor-directive.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ampSCOPED-DEFINE-preprocessor-directive.html\">&amp;SCOPED-DEFINE preprocessor directive</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DEFINE-WORKFILE-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DEFINE-WORKFILE-statement.html\">DEFINE WORKFILE statement</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DELETE-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DELETE-statement.html\">DELETE statement</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/309282","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1470,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"DEFINED preprocessor function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DEFINED-preprocessor-function.html","type":"Manual"}